    <title>Where work stalls</title>
    <link href="https://aculich.github.io/blog/2026/05/01/where-work-stalls/" />
    <updated>2026-05-01T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <id>https://aculich.github.io/blog/2026/05/01/where-work-stalls/</id>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;Where work stalls&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Where initiatives stagnate is almost always the human-to-human layer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People freeze, not just slow down, in the face of systems they feel they cannot control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listening restores &lt;strong&gt;personal agency&lt;/strong&gt; → &lt;strong&gt;team agency&lt;/strong&gt; → &lt;strong&gt;systemic response.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
